<%-include('layouts/header')%><section class="appearance-page"><span class="eyebrow">STORE MANAGEMENT</span><h1>Make Bancom your own</h1><p>Choose a colour theme for the entire store. Selecting a preset previews it here; saving applies it for all visitors.</p><%if(saved){%><p class="profile-success" role="status">Theme saved for your store. <a href="/">View storefront ↗</a></p><%}%><form method="POST" id="appearance-form"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%=csrfToken%>"><fieldset class="theme-options"><legend>Choose a theme</legend><%themes.forEach(t=>{%><label class="theme-option"><input type="radio" name="theme" value="<%=t.id%>" <%=siteTheme===t.id?'checked':''%> required><span class="theme-swatch" style="background:<%=t.paper%>;border-color:<%=t.line%>"><i style="background:<%=t.green%>"></i><i style="background:<%=t.soft%>"></i><i style="background:<%=t.ink%>"></i></span><strong><%=t.name%></strong><small><%=t.description%></small></label><%})%></fieldset><label class="theme-hero-toggle"><input type="checkbox" name="heroFollowsTheme" <%=heroFollowsTheme?'checked':''%>> Apply theme colours to the homepage hero too</label><p class="field-hint">Your custom hero colours stay saved. Turn this off to use them again. Product photos and chart data colours stay unchanged.</p><section class="theme-preview" aria-label="Theme preview"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR STORE, YOUR STYLE</span><h2>A fresh look for everyday tech.</h2><p>Preview text, surfaces, borders and buttons before applying your theme.</p><span class="primary-link">Primary button</span><span class="theme-secondary">Secondary button</span></section><p id="theme-preview-status" role="status">Current theme: <%=themes.find(t=>t.id===siteTheme)?.name%></p><div class="profile-actions"><a href="/">Cancel</a><button type="submit" class="primary-link">Save site theme</button></div></form></section><script src="/javascripts/appearance.js" defer></script><%-include('layouts/footer')%>